# Settings the preloop2 build changed relative to the 6.1.175 config it was
# derived from: nested KVM, netfilter/nftables, bridge, device-mapper, btrfs,
# DAMON reclaim/LRU sort, virtio-fs/vsock and the rest of what CI workloads
# need. That starting config's provenance was not recorded; it is neither
# Firecracker's microvm-kernel-ci 6.1 config nor the config of kvcache-ai's
# published vmlinux-6.1.175. Merge onto a new LTS base before
# preloop-x86_64-<series>.fragment. Toolchain-derived and arch-capability
# symbols are omitted.

